<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/Assets/UI/widgets/widgets.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/Assets/UI/demo.rcss"/>
    <style>
        .crosshair { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 40dp; height: 40dp; margin-left: -20dp; margin-top: -20dp;
                     text-align: center; line-height: 40dp; font-size: 34dp; color: #ffffff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="hud" data-model="worldui">
    <div class="demo-panel">
        <h1>World UI</h1>
        <p class="hint">Signs are Label3D text in the scene; nameplates, the prompt and the waypoint are UiMarker3D rows on one HUD document.</p>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Hide markers behind buildings</span><input type="checkbox" data-checked="occlusion"/></div>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Scale markers with distance</span><input type="checkbox" data-checked="scale"/></div>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Fixed-size debug tags</span><input type="checkbox" data-checked="tags"/></div>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Orbit the camera</span><input type="checkbox" data-checked="orbit"/></div>
        <p class="hint">The terminal is a UiPanel3D: click its button to open the gate. Tab aims a crosshair at it instead.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="crosshair" data-if="crosshair">+</div>
</body>
</rml>
